WEBVTT

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.020
This doesn't make sense.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.340
Geez.

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:48.190
Mom.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:55.700
What is it?

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.140
What do you think you're doing?!

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:15.340
Don't cling to me like that! You're annoying.

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.080
I-I'm starving.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.390
Isn't there anything in the fridge?

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.910
As I always say, eat whatever you want.

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.770
I-I want something sweet.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.320
I-I want to eat something like a cake.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:31.610
Cake?

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.340
What a spoiled girl.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:37.370
If you want to eat it that much, why don't you use your allowance to buy it at a convenience store?

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:41.410
I want to eat one that you baked.

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:43.410
How can I bake?!

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.060
When do you think my deadline is?!

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:46.920
It's tomorrow! Tomorrow!

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:50.330
First of all, didn't I tell you not to enter this room when I'm working?!

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:51.880
Now, get out!

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:56.500
You always take on the next job so quickly.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.320
Mom, you were kinder in the past!

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:01.100
You're always angry now!

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:04.470
I hate you now, Mom!

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.560
Go die! Mom, you're an idiot!

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:13.630
Then, why don't you leave?

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:16.740
You're living on the money I earn.

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:19.570
How can you say, "Go die," you stupid girl?

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:20.230
Now, hurry and get out. Out!

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:21.890
No! It hurts!
Now, hurry and get out. Out!

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:23.210
Stop it! It hurts! It hurts!
Now, hurry and get out. Out!

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:23.950
Out, out!
Stop it! It hurts! It hurts!

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:32.520
If you're annoyed, why don't you earn your keep on the streets or something.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.460
Idiot.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.100
It's not stylish.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:17.470
Eiji, the cakes you make aren't stylish.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.110
Shut up!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.570
So my cakes don't look stylish!

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:25.080
What was in it?

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.030
Like I said,

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.970
it's a fig butter cake.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:28.990
Now, now.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.840
Let's try it first.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.930
Oh, all right.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:40.940
It looks like a pound cake.

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:42.260
It tastes good!

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.210
And it has a nice aroma too!

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:50.210
Because of the lavish use of butter, the cake is soft and tasty.

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:52.770
The texture of the figs differs from the cake, and that's good.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.400
I want to start selling this as soon as possible.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:04:59.440
Are you sure?

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:03.060
I can see what you were thinking.

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:07.370
If it's made well, it will garner many repeat customers.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:09.160
Thank you very much!

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:14.880
But, you'll need to change some of the ingredients, as well as the baking time.

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:18.780
The appearance can be simple, but it should be a bit more stylish.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:20.270
Do your best.

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:21.840
Y-Yes!

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:23.780
It's going well.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:26.550
Finally, Ono's showing some leadership.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.730
Chi-chan.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.860
D-Deko-chan!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.900
Wh-What happened?! It's midnight.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:45.860
Chi-chan...

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:59.220
Would you let me stay at your house tonight?

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:08.120
So Deko-chan, here's some cocoa.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:13.640
Come on. You like it, don't you?

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.230
What's going on?

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.580
I don't know,

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.870
but she's really cute.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.530
Kei-chan, your face is weird.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:25.940
It's not cool.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.840
Sh-Shut up.

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.320
It <i>is</i> cool.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:31.320
If you keep saying that...

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.600
There.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.560
I'm gonna rub you with this beard!

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.240
No! Stop it, Kei-chan!
I'm gonna rub you with this beard!

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.460
No! Stop it, Kei-chan!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.130
It tickles, Kei-chan.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.600
Ch-Chikage-san.
It tickles, Kei-chan.

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:40.170
Ch-Chikage-san.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.580
What's going on?

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.670
Umm... She's Kaedeko-chan.

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:48.630
So she's a child of Tachibana's cousin.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:50.800
No, she's not.

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:54.960
I don't mind if gramps gets arrested for dating schoolgirls,

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:57.220
but what will happen to this shop?

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:01.020
Now Deko, drink your cocoa while it's hot.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:01.770
Okay.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:04.710
Chikage, you take care of Deko.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:06.050
Hasn't it been quite a while?

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:06.400
Yes!

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:10.090
I wonder who that girl is.

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.070
Who knows?

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.120
Is it good?

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:18.830
Yeah.

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:20.420
I see.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.090
Chi-chan!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.590
Chi is also dating a schoolgirl?!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.920
Please listen, Chi-chan.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:36.640
What?

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:42.600
Mom used to hug me and let me cling to her like this.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.190
But now she doesn't.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:49.320
So I tried holding on to her like this.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:53.140
Then she hit me.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:02.370
Mom hates me.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:11.280
You're living on the money I earn.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.510
How can you say, "Go die," you stupid girl?

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:36.370
Deko-chan, in your eyes, Mom looks like a mature woman, doesn't she?

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:37.910
Yeah.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:42.020
But, Mom also has tough times.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:45.120
When adults are having a rough time,

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:49.360
they too want someone to cling to, just like you did.

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:50.820
Did you know that?

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:52.840
Is that so?

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:56.820
Deko-chan, you're so big now.

00:08:56.820 --> 00:09:02.840
If Mom seems to be having a rough time, you must be her mom.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:08.600
Even someone who seems strong and able to handle everything...

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:10.390
can go through rough times too.

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:12.650
Chikage!

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:13.770
Young master!

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.120
Don't... Don't tell...

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:17.570
Don't tell anyone...

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:20.080
I won't!

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:22.480
I won't...

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:25.830
I won't tell anyone.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:29.960
Okay?

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.460
Yeah.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.300
Kaedeko.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.020
Mom!

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:44.280
Yo, Sakurako.

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:45.290
You stupid girl.
Yo, Sakurako.

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.080
You stupid girl.

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:47.800
You made me look for you.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:49.030
No!

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:51.130
Sakurako-san, don't hit her!

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.390
What, Chikage?

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:55.150
Are you acting like a father now?

00:09:58.010 --> 00:09:59.290
Tachibana!

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.940
Who is whose...

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:03.120
...f-father?

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:05.000
Well,

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.620
this is her...

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:09.880
...father?

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.350
Are you sure?

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.650
Umm...

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.610
Chi, you're her father?

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.120
Yes.

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:40.570
Well, that's how it is.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:44.780
By the way, I currently have a different boyfriend.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.510
That's not the issue.

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:50.440
So Chikage-san did it too.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:52.750
So he knew how to make children.

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.220
Back then, I was in a hurry,

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:04.120
A literary prize worth one million yen.
because I'd won the Naoki Prize and become very busy at work.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.430
And I was nearly forty.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.680
The Naoki Prize?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:13.270
Then you must be the novelist, Sakaki Sakurako?

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:14.440
The author who wrote "Afterglow."

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.110
So you read it?

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.570
Y-Yes.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:25.490
The truth is, the descriptions of sex between men and women were so vivid that I couldn't finish it.

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:29.010
I just wanted a child.

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:32.030
I thought it wouldn't matter who it was as long as he had sperm.

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:33.440
Deko-chan, do you like your cocoa?
I thought it wouldn't matter who it was as long as he had sperm.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:34.190
And I met Chikage at Keiichirou's party.
Deko-chan, do you like your cocoa?

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:35.170
Yes.
And I met Chikage at Keiichirou's party.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.850
And I met Chikage at Keiichirou's party.

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:37.710
Yes.

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:40.770
That's even more vivid than the novel.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.100
But, why Chi of all people?

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.510
Think about it.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:50.890
If a child inherited my brains and Chi's looks,

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:53.290
wouldn't that be the greatest?

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.930
And... the result is...

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:01.670
Chikage's looks and his brains as well.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:04.160
Well, that's like one win and one loss.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:05.790
What are you talking about?

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:10.030
Geez, stop laughing like an idiot.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:13.880
That's why you can't recite the multiplication tables even though you're a fourth grader.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:16.280
A fourth grader?!

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:18.500
But she's tall, and she has breasts.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:21.510
Well, she really looks like a high school student.

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:22.570
Doesn't she?

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:24.360
Only her body's big.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.930
My antique...
Only her body's big.

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:25.990
Imagine being jumped on by a girl like that.
My antique...

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:28.470
Imagine being jumped on by a girl like that.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:32.390
I have a bad back, and that will make it worse.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:36.770
Mom, are you sick?

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.150
Uh... yeah.

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:42.420
Wasn't it a hernia?

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:45.940
It can be cured, so do some exercise.

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.120
Shut up!

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.190
Geez...

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:52.330
Sakurako-san, why didn't you tell Deko-chan about it?

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.440
Because if I told her, it would make her worry.

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:58.880
Geez, this even makes me sound crazy.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.350
Mom...

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:05.930
Oh yes, Deko-chan. Would you like some cake?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:06.800
Yeah!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:11.930
Unfortunately, our gifted pâtissier's cakes are sold out,

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:14.430
and we only have a plain cake made by his apprentice.

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:16.270
Shut up, gramps!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.770
I'd like to try it.

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:20.270
I want to have the cake the apprentice made.

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:22.150
Are you sure?

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:23.570
Yeah!

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:25.740
O-Okay.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.320
Wait a sec. I'll bring it right now!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.500
It looks good!

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.670
It's a cake I made.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:40.630
Try it.

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:41.400
Okay.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:47.790
Yummy!

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:48.820
Are you sure?

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:50.180
Are you sure that it's yummy?

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.180
Yes, it's yummy!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.640
It's like Mom's cake.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:03.110
Our shop may serve some purpose.

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:09.950
Your shop serves simple cakes on antique tableware.

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:14.160
So, let's go home, Kaedeko.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.500
I won't mind holding your hand.

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.080
Yeah!

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.010
See you, Deko-chan.

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.510
Come during the day next time.

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:31.980
You can have more delicious cakes.

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:32.910
Yeah.

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:36.850
I'll also learn more, and make a lot of cakes.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:38.560
Yeah.

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:41.460
Hey, Sakurako.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:44.370
Deko's breasts are gonna cause a crime if you don't do something about them.

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:46.600
At least buy her a bra.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:47.780
It's all right.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:50.660
She's going to get even bigger. There's still time.

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:53.530
Are you really her mother?

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:54.910
Don't you think Deko is being treated poorly?

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.630
She's not.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:15:00.590
When her period started, the school took care of her.

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:03.130
Nowadays, the school takes care of all that stuff.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.850
You...

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:05.590
No!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:08.570
Kei-chan, don't scold Mom.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:12.550
If you bother her, I won't forgive you.

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.480
Sakurako!

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:18.170
Did you hear that?

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:21.410
How about her filial piety?

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.560
You men just don't get it.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.980
I raised her to be like that.

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:28.650
Yeah.

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:37.610
They really are alike.

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:52.380
So, shall we clean up?

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:05.150
Who would've thought that you'd have a child like that?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:12.610
I think at that time, Sakurako really, really wanted a child.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:16.610
She was raised in quite a harsh family,

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:19.150
so she might've wanted a family of her own.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:23.290
But do people normally help out with that?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:27.500
Chikage always does whatever he can to help.

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:30.840
And it felt really good!

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.760
Yeah, I know, I know.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:36.720
Those old ladies can be quite good at it!

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.370
Stop it.

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:41.180
I feel sick...

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:43.660
Are you all right, Ono-san?!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.100
It's your fault.

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:49.840
I'll bring some water!

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:55.600
He really likes children,

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:59.670
but he thought he couldn't be a proper father.

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:04.610
He knew he wouldn't be able to live with her, yet he still accepted Sakurako's demand.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:12.760
But, when Sakurako couldn't take care of the baby and asked him to,

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:16.010
he took care of Deko.

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:19.660
That's the kind of man he is.

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:25.730
But the one who really took care of her was me.

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:29.100
Ono-san, here's your water.

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:31.670
Th-Thank you, Chikage-san.

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:35.170
Chi, you're a really good guy.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.070
Huh?

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:39.280
She's a cute girl, that Deko-chan.

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:40.860
Yes, she is!

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:55.490
Come on! Don't lean on me.

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:57.350
Don't put your weight on me.

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.600
Sorry, Mom.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.800
Hey, after tomorrow's deadline,

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:08.200
should I make you butter cake like I used to?

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.530
No, I don't want it.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.940
What? You don't you want it?

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.070
Right.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:20.680
Instead, could you teach me how to make that cake?

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:24.910
I'm in the fourth grade now, so I'll make you a cake.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:32.800
Children can be cute at unexpected times.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:33.970
Oh, my.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:37.470
I'm glad I had a child.

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.250
I'm glad.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.460
Deko-chan was really cute.

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.320
Hey, Chi.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.610
Why don't the three of you all live together?

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:00.600
No.

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:04.690
I was treated well at the young master's house after my Mom passed away.

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:07.080
I will serve the young master until I die.

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:11.120
Come on, I'm the one taking care of you.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:14.170
I can't stand the idea of this going on forever.

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:18.780
Then, I'll serve you until you're all right by yourself.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:21.140
He's saying it, gramps.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.820
Shut up, brat.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:25.010
Well then, I'm starving.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:27.220
Why don't we go eat somewhere just this once?

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:30.060
Oh! Then I'll pay for it.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.240
Let's eat sushi.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:32.600
There's a very good restaurant near here.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:33.880
I can't eat it if the wasabi's left in.
There's a very good restaurant near here.

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:35.980
I can't eat it if the wasabi's left in.

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:38.280
I hate raw stuff.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:40.620
You guys...

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:42.650
Then what about barbecue? Barbecue!

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:44.280
You can't complain if it's meat, right?

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:47.030
It might be a bit far, but there's a nice restaurant—

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:49.310
I-I don't want barbecue.

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:52.420
The smell will get into my new jacket.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.950
What should I eat?

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:03.130
I'll have a hamburger.

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:03.760
Me too.

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:05.970
A hamburger?

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:11.980
I was willing to buy crunchy halibut fin or fatty sea urchin roe.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:13.200
Geez.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:19.320
The one who is missing now is Kousuke-kun, nine years old,

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:23.280
the first son of Hosokai-san, an office worker.

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:27.070
Kousuke-kun has been missing for two days now.

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:33.330
The police are investigating whether he might have been involved in an incident or an accident.

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:35.250
Kousuke-kun was...

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:38.080
Hey, here's your beer!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:46.840
Young master, you can drink, but you must also eat properly too.

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:50.880
You might awake in the middle of the night starving.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.230
I'm not like you.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:55.810
I want simmered flatfish.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.440
Yes, sir! One simmered flatfish!

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:02.350
As I thought, a favor from gramps is just like gramps himself.

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:04.210
Shut up!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.080
This is nice.
